.env
.worker/
SETUP.md
__pycache__/
.obsidian

# Per-engagement data: never committed (public repo). Only the docs + skeleton are tracked.
/engagements/*
!/engagements/README.md
!/engagements/_TEMPLATE/

# Engagement config holds real targets/scope/allowlist once filled in — keep it off the public repo.
# GOAL.md + SCOPE.md live per-engagement under engagements/<name>/ (ignored above).
# PROJECT.md stays at the root for delegate.py, but the filled-in copy is never committed
# (PROJECT.example.md is the committed template).
/PROJECT.md
/GOAL.md
/SCOPE.md